# Agent commit-message draft. Authored at the repo root so vale's
# [formats] mapping resolves it, linted via `just lint-commit-msg`,
# then consumed with `git commit -F COMMIT_AGENTMSG`. Never committed.
COMMIT_AGENTMSG

# Agent pull request drafts, the same idea one stage later.
# PR_AGENTDESC.md holds the description for as long as the pull request
# stays open, and merge-pr removes it once the branch merges.
# SQUASH_AGENTMSG holds the squash commit message that skill writes.
# Linted via `just lint-pr-description` and `just lint-squash-msg`.
PR_AGENTDESC.md
SQUASH_AGENTMSG

